<title>USA: PartnerRe Ltd completes SAFR acquisition.</title>
<headline>PartnerRe Ltd completes SAFR acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PartnerRe Ltd said Thursday it has completed the previously announced acquisition of 100 percent of France's SAFR for about 5.4 billion francs or about $912 million.</p>
<p>The company also said it has closed the $250 million offering of its 8.0 percent series A cumulative preferred shares, which provided a portion of the acquisition financing.</p>
</text>
